      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akiolol a ŋuna a Tiro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lokoku a ituŋanan, togeu tokona akiolol aŋuna a Tiro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tolimok Tiro, etaun ŋolo edukitoe neni elomarere nanam, ŋolo eyakasi ŋiboro a ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋuna eya diyete anam atemar, alimu Ekapolon Akuj ŋakiro nu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Apotu ŋituŋa a Tarisis kicurutata kaapei ka ŋituŋa kon, anerae ibarit iyoŋ ŋiboro nooi; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon ikiinakis iyoŋ esilipa, ŋasuwa, ŋasuwa ŋuna enyaritae tin ka ŋasuwa ŋuna apotyok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Gireece, a Tubal ka ŋulu a Mesec kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ, apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋituŋa ka ŋiboro ŋulu itiyaunitae a eburonis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Bes-Togarima yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋaŋolei ŋunakitiyaet ka ŋuna a ejie ta ŋaŋolei-sigirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Rodes kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ ka apotu ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋuna eya diyete anam toruworos ŋikagyelak ŋuluyenen ŋulu a ŋiboro kon; apotu ikes ikitacakis iyoŋ ŋikyal a ŋitome ka ŋakito ŋuna agogoŋok ba ba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Edom kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ aŋuna alalata nooi ŋiboro kon; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋamoru ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Yasiper, ŋilowi ŋulu kipura-areŋak, ŋiboro ŋulu esibusitae, ŋilowi ŋulu ajokak ŋulu amilimilak, ŋiboro ŋulu epol egyelit nooi ka ŋinapito ŋulu amilimilak nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋulu a Isirael kicurutata ka iyoŋ; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋaganoi ŋuna alo Minisis, ŋakima, ao, akimyet ka ekitoe ŋolo a ŋajemei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Damasko kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ aŋuna alalata nooi ŋiboro kon ka iyakar iyoŋ ŋiboro ŋulu egelegelya ŋulu alalak nooi ikwapei epiini ŋolo ayaunitae alo Elibon ka ŋajul a ŋamesekin ŋuna akwaŋak ŋuna ayaunitae alo Saar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Dan ka ŋulu a Gireece ŋulu aponito alo Usal kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋasuwa ŋunadelet, ŋakito a ŋiwo ka ŋakasirim ŋuna abokok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Dedan kicurutata ka iyoŋ; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋilowi ŋulu asonyitae erae ŋisaaja ŋulu emetere ŋaŋolei, kori ŋisigirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa ka Arabia ka ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a Kedar toruworos ŋikagyelak ŋulu ajokak ŋulu a ŋiboro kon; apotu ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin, ŋimeesekin ka ŋamee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋimucurus ŋulu a Seba ka Raama kicurutata kaapei ka iyoŋ; apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋikito daadaŋ ŋulu egelegelya ŋulu itoboboete akimuj ka ŋamoru daadaŋ ŋuna epol egyelit ta egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa ka Aran, Kane, Eden ka ŋimucurus ŋulu a Seba, Asur ka Kilimad kicurutata ka iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes yaasi ŋiboro kon, ikiinakis iyoŋ ŋilowi ŋulu ebusak, ŋilowi ŋulupusiyek, ŋiboro ŋulu esibusitae ka ŋiboro ŋulu epesyo kwap ŋulu enyalal ŋiraŋgi, ŋiboro ŋulu aenitae ŋulu amam epite ŋolo ecakarotor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Apotu ŋameeli ŋuna a Tarisis kiwoko ka kiwokununut ŋiboro kon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
